rp1-gpclk-dkms (0.0.0~phase5.54-2) experimental; urgency=medium

  * Restrict automatic builds to stock Raspberry Pi kernel package names so
    unrelated historical custom kernel trees are skipped by DKMS.
  * Stage overlays below /usr/lib and copy them with guarded maintainer
    scripts, avoiding dpkg hard-link backups on /boot/firmware filesystems.

